DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261116T200000
UID:6adfaf4689c59785520c5647@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:All impassioned fans of Heated Rivalry (Rachel Reid's\nGame Ch
 angers\nseries and the hit Crave television show) are welcome to join us a
 t the Parkdale branch for Heated Rivalry Trivia Night! Questions will pred
 ominately include facts from the TV series as well as the novel.\nMeet fel
 low Heated Rivalry enthusiasts and test your knowledge about everything He
 ated Rivalry to compete for a prize! Participants will be split into team
 s of five to discuss final answers and the team with the most correct ans
 wers will win. There will be 6 rounds\, with a total of 48 questions.\nWe'
 re coming to the library!\nProgram is for 18+ Adults\nDoors open at 6:00pm
 \, program will start at 6:30pm.\nOn-theme beverages will be provided.\nIn
 formation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is col
 lected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sect
 ions 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for even
 t and program registration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how 
 the library handles your information can be directed to Answerline staff a
 t\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 
 2G8.
LOCATION:Parkdale\, Auditorium A
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6adfaf4689c59785520c5647
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Young Adults
