DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261120T130000
UID:6af1dd258389bd86bfa5015e@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Curious about how your personal and career values can shape yo
 ur motivation\, sense of purpose\, and satisfaction at work? You’ll iden
 tify your core values\, reflect on where they currently show up in your wo
 rk or life\, and explore where there may be conflicts. You’ll also learn
  how to use your values as an “internal compass” when evaluating caree
 r options and making decisions about your next steps. Through interactive 
 activities and reflection\, you’ll leave with a clearer understanding of
  what matters most to you.\nNeed help with Zoom?\n-\nJoining and participa
 ting in a Zoom webinar\n-\nZoom Privacy Statement\nThis program is part of
  TPL's Career Coaches in Residence and is generously supported by our lead
  donor Azrieli Foundation along with supporting donors Fidelity Canada\, F
 riends of Toronto Public Library\, South Chapter and\nThe William and Nona
