SUMMARY:Reading Challenge Book Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261123T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261123T190000
UID:6a904dc058433600542b83d7@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to Locke's Book Club\, where we will explore titles f
 rom categories of the\n2026 Reading Challenge\n.\nConnect with other read
 ers\, dive deeper into this year's categories through meaningful discussio
 n\, and learn about titles and formats you may not normally read. Each Boo
 k Club session will be facilitated by our staff\, who will provide a list 
 of titles you can choose for each month\, based on a category from TPL's 
