 nSuspiria\n(1977)\, directed by Dario Argento.\nThis dreamy\, psychotronic
  Gothic from Italian horror-master Argento follows a new student as she en
 ters a prestigious ballet academy\, where she is troubled by strange and s
 inister goings-on behind the institution's walls.\nSuspiria\nhas a running
  time of 1 hour and 32 minutes\, and is rated 18A.\nThere will be a short 
