DESCRIPTION:November is Financial Literacy Month.\nFeeling like your money
  doesn’t go far as it used to? You’re not alone. Presented by financia
 l empowerment staff from WoodGreen Community Services\, this session will 
 explore practical ways to manage your budget\, reduce expenses\, and make 
 the most of available benefits and programs. We’ll share simple strategi
 es to help you stay on top of spending\, stretch your dollars further\, an
 d plan ahead.\nAfter the session\, stay to chat with Financial Empowerment
  (FE) staff from WoodGreen Community Services for a\nbrief one-on-one supp
 ort\n.\nDrop-in welcome!\nNo registration required. Snacks and refreshment
 s are provided for all participants. Ingredient lists will be available at
