 c\, much like our libraries? This interactive workshop invites you to imag
 ine AI as a public resource\, one that is accessible to everyone\, account
 able to the people it serves\, and developed with the public interest in m
 ind. Join us to share your experiences\, imagine new possibilities and hel
 p shape a vision for Public AI in Canada.\nThis workshop is part of TPL's\
 nAI Summit\nand presented by Public AI Lab Canada in collaboration with De
 mocracyXChange.
LOCATION:Toronto Reference Library\, Activity Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aede2349b955d531f7d82bc
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Young Adults
END:VEVENT
