DESCRIPTION:In this follow up course we will be looking into making user 
 interfaces with the Python module tkinter.\nPython is an open source progr
 amming language that is used for creating web applications\, web content\,
  mathematics and system scripting. In this follow up course we will take o
 ur understanding of data structures to the next level as well as looking i
 nto the next stages of error handling (including making some custom error 
 messages) and extending our knowledge of input/output to more than just th
 e terminal.\nThis class is for beginners but assumes you have a basic unde
 rstanding of Python or have attended Coding with Python I\, II\, III and I
 V.\nPrior to the class\, participants will need to download and install Py
 thon and VS Code onto their personal computers (installation guides provid
 ed after registration).\nRegistration is limited and specific instructions
  including information about software installation will be provided.\nInfo
 rmation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is colle
