DESCRIPTION:Join us for an engaging discussion with one of TPL's expert C
 areer Coaches in Residence\, Jermaine L Murray.\nBuilding a professional 
 brand is crucial for career and job success. Become easier to find\, tru
 st\, remember and recommend\nExplore professional reputation\, LinkedIn vi
 sibility and authentic relationship building. Participants refine how they
  explain their strengths and what they want to be known for. Participant 
 takeaway: An improved LinkedIn headline\, positioning statement and visibi
 lity plan.\nJermaine L Murray is a  Career Coach and Recruitment Strate
 gist helping professionals build stronger careers by improving how they po
 sition themselves\, communicate their value\, and navigate the job market.
  Known as “The Jobfather\,” Jermaine brings nearly a decade of experi
 ence in recruitment\, career coaching\, and talent strategy. Jermaine spec
 ializes in helping job seekers identify what distinguishes them\, translat
 e their experience into a compelling professional story\, and approach the
 ir search with greater clarity and confidence.\nThis is an in person-event
  and takes place at the North York Central library branch.\nQuestions rega
 rding the event can be emailed to ccir@tpl.ca
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Room 2/3
