 out under any tree.\nParticipants are welcome to bring two 6" x 8" boxes\,
  or two small items of a similar size\, to practice wrapping.\nRegistratio
 n is required.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information o
 n this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Li
 braries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will onl
