BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Learning Circle (with KERRY'S PLACE AUTISM SERVICES): Parenting a 
 Child with a Disability
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20270114T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20270114T143000
UID:6af74193899b610033136d11@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:A bi-monthly gathering designed to provide a supportive\, safe
 \, and welcoming space for parents or caregivers raising children with dis
 abilities. Meetings will include open discussions as well as guest speaker
 s\, including professionals and advocates\, to provide valuable insights o
 n relevant topics.\nWhether you're seeking support\, advice\, or simply a 
 space to share\, we welcome you to join us. Together we can navigate the c
 hallenges and celebrate the joys of parenting a child with a disability.\n
 For this\nFourteenth\nSession\, Andreia Torres\, Autism Consultant at Kerr
 y's Place Autism Services\nwill be our guest speaker. Session Dates and Gu
 est Speakers will be announced as they become confirmed.
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, 2nd Floor-\nRoom 2/3
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6af74193899b610033136d11
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Young Adults
END:VEVENT
