UID:6ab5a6473dd190003e746a27@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Get your spook on with this month's scary movie screening of\
 nSuspiria\n(1977)\, directed by Dario Argento.\nThis dreamy\, psychotronic
  Gothic from Italian horror-master Argento follows a new student as she en
 ters a prestigious ballet academy\, where she is troubled by strange and s
 inister goings-on behind the institution's walls.\nSuspiria\nhas a running
  time of 1 hour and 32 minutes\, and is rated 18A.\nThere will be a short 
 introduction to the film followed by the screening\, which will be accompa
 nied by closed captions.\nThe next Screen Scaries will be:\nDecember 28\, 
 2026:\nBlack Christmas\n(1974\, USA) Bob Clark. Runtime: 1h37m\; Rating: R
 \nJanuary 25\, 2027:\nRing\n(1998\, Japan) Hideo Nakata. Runtime: 1h35m\; 
 Rating: PG
